Package: web888-ng-bitstream
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, web888-redpitaya (>= 2025.430-3)
Description: Open FPGA bitstreams for Web-888 (web888-ng-hw v0.3.0)
 Prebuilt open FPGA bitstreams from jeskko/web888-ng-hw v0.3.0 (CI build,
 Vivado 2026.1, stock-compatible register map, timing met): websdr_hf.bit
 (HF, 12 RX + 2 WF, signature 0x0E5D020C) and websdr_vhf.bit (VHF, 13 RX +
 2 WF, signature 0x0E5D020D; hardware-untested upstream, not selected by
 any shipped service). Checksums and upstream build provenance
 (SHA256SUMS, wns.txt, Vivado licence note) install alongside the
 artifacts under /usr/share/web888-ng/firmware/.
 .
 Nothing here is loaded automatically: the runtime selection helper
 /usr/lib/web888/web888-fpga-select (web888-redpitaya) decides which
 bitstream reaches the FPGA. Stock bitstreams are NOT shipped in this
 package; no files overlap or overwrite stock firmware or runtime state.
